{"product_id":"hooks-revenge-book-1-hooks-revenge-hooks-revenge-book-1-hooks-revenge-1","title":"Hook's Revenge, Book 1","description":"\u003cp\u003eTwelve-year-old Jocelyn dreams of becoming every bit as daring as her infamous father, Captain James Hook. Her grandfather, on the other hand, intends to see her starched and pressed into a fine society lady. When she‰Ûªs sent to Miss Eliza Crumb-Biddlecomb‰Ûªs Finishing School for Young Ladies, Jocelyn‰Ûªs hopes of following in her father‰Ûªs fearsome footsteps are lost in a heap of dance lessons, white gloves, and way too much pink.So when Jocelyn receives a letter from her father challenging her to avenge his untimely demise at the jaws of the Neverland crocodile, she doesn‰Ûªt hesitate‰Û¥here at last is the adventure she has been waiting for. But Jocelyn finds that being a pirate is a bit more difficult than she‰Ûªd bargained for. As if attempting to defeat the Neverland‰Ûªs most fearsome beast isn‰Ûªt enough to deal with, she‰Ûªs tasked with captaining a crew of woefully untrained pirates, outwitting cannibals wild for English cuisine, and rescuing her best friend from a certain pack of lost children, not to mention that pesky Peter Pan who keeps barging in uninvited.The crocodile‰Ûªs clock is always ticking in Heidi Schulz‰Ûªs debut novel, a story told by an irascible narrator who is both dazzlingly witty and sharp as a sword. Will Jocelyn find the courage to beat the incessant monster before time runs out?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 131 x 191\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Heidi Schulz\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781484711880\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 320\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45304403951769,"sku":"14RE9781484711880","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67fd0e2100a4e_Hook_s_Revenge__Book_1_Hook_s_Revenge__Hook_s_Revenge__Book_1___Hook_s_Reven